{"title": "Army Arcana", "pageid": 44282, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Army_Arcana", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sculpt_Spells.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sculpt_Spells.webp/300px-Sculpt_Spells.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Sculpt_Spells.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sculpt_Spells.webp/300px-Sculpt_Spells.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sculpt_Spells.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Army Arcana</b> is a passive feature that prevents your allies from taking damage from your spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Create pockets of safety within your spells. Allies automatically succeed their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against these spells and take no damage from them. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lizabett\" title=\"Lizabett\">Lizabett</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stropes\" title=\"Stropes\">Stropes</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Allies automatically succeed Saving Throws against the user's spells.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715115133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2871/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1791/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 181/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643696/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.420      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   28.420      1 -total\n 31.60%    8.980      1 Template:SavingThrow\n 29.44%    8.366      1 Template:Icon_text\n 25.59%    7.274      2 Template:Trim\n 22.48%    6.388      1 Template:Ifempty\n 19.10%    5.429      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.94%    3.677      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 11.46%    3.256      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.66%    3.029      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:44282-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715115133 and revision id 216341. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}